  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/dawn-craft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GHypdtP/Untitled-design-10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"920\" height=\"279\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/dawn-craft\" rel=\"nofollow\">專為 DawnCraft 模組包打造</a></p><p>新增內容：</p><p>- 受薩爾達傳說啟發的方塊與物品，用於創建地牢</p><p>- 自訂結構</p><p>- 調整使地圖在關閉手持渲染時仍能顯示於 HUD</p><p>- 4 種藥水效果，可施加各種視覺與操控改變效果</p><p>- 7 個獨特的支線任務，並提供不同獎勵</p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fsmiley\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/63aa6891-b5b5-4f3b-9ee5-ab0b7a577e98.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"678\" height=\"113\"></a></p>",
